\newlabel{fig:reward_fcn}{{5}{7}{Overview of the Reward Subsystem in the Simulink Model \texttt {SpaceRobot.slx} \\ This figure illustrates the reward and termination logic implemented as a MATLAB function block. The reward is computed from end-effector position and velocity errors, base linear and angular velocities, control effort, and torque smoothness}{figure.caption.6}{}}
